ent-Version`? I couldn't confirm it, so the README example will use a placeholder for now.\n- **Q3:** should the README mention that logout/refresh are blocked too? I suggest just saying \"logged-in endpoints\".\n\nNEEDS-HUMAN-INPUT: The brief leaves undecided whether the three variables go into `.env` (commented out or with defaults) or only into the README, so TASK-3 is blocked until you decide.","ttft_ms":1848,"type":"result","duration_ms":76747,"uuid":"cdbcd182-c186-484a-8894-b2ef989a88a3","ttft_stream_ms":864,"time_to_request_ms":108,"first_content_frame_ms":864,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

